# Claude Code agent scratch space. `.claude/skills/` is deliberately NOT here:
# those five skills are project knowledge (deploy flow, local QA, design system,
# project pages, workflow nodes) and encode real incidents. Ignoring them meant
# a `git worktree` — which is how agents do feature work — checked out CLAUDE.md
# but none of the skills, so the guidance was missing exactly where it was
# needed, and edits to it died on the next clone.
.claude/worktrees/
.claude/settings.json

# Playwright artifacts
test-results/
playwright-report/
.playwright/
